ending."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Complete and Balanced Electrolyte Formula for:\n- Replacing electrolytes after severe vomiting or diarrhea*\n- Improving hydration*\n- Increasing energy and stamina*\n- Shorter recovery after exercise*\n- Preventing muscle cramps and weakness*"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"ELS030"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"For Professional Use Only"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Recommended Use: As a dietary supplement, take one packet (approx. 11.5 grams) per day, or as directed by your health care practitioner."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"The energizing ingredients of Electrolyte Synergy(TM) include the body’s four main electrolytes (calcium, magnesium, sodium, and potassium) along with d-ribose and taurine."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Ribose is essential for exercise performance and recovery by resynthesizing adenosine-triphosphate (ATP), resulting in a boost of muscle energy, including the heart muscle. Ribose may also help to prevent symptoms such as cramping, pain, and stiffness after exercise. Taurine helps the body to balance electrolytes and retain magnesium. In addition to beneficial actions for cardiac tissue, taurine is magnesium-sparing for the entire body.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"May be used by children and adults ."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Does not contain gluten."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"GREAT TASTING GRAPE FLAVOR"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Manufactured in a GMP CERTIFIED Facility"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"STORE IN A COOL, DRY PLACE."}],"claims":[{"